Package: stow
Title: Durable Package-Scoped File Downloads and Caching
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Cole", "Brokamp", , "cole@colebrokamp.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0289-3151"))
Description: Downloads files into durable, package-scoped user data
    directories using names derived from source URLs and entity tags.
    Supports offline cache lookup, content validation, and transactional
    replacement.
